    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 About</h2>War Room: Blitz is a single-player, turn-based strategy game based on historical events of the second half of 1940 and the first half of 1941. Test your luck and your managing skills in this fast-paced unit management game. Control your units and lead your country to victory!<br><br>With almost no artificial restrictions put in place, your ability to lead is the only thing that separates you from winning or loosing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a38ee0d7473edff28652108ace9e0bd9.avif?t=1716620124\" width=320 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Keep an eye on your units </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Micromanage of the squadrons on your side, or play loosey-goosey and send them off to distant lands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Upgrade your stuff</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/abbc97bb0997d0e070b52df289d49540.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/abbc97bb0997d0e070b52df289d49540.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/abbc97bb0997d0e070b52df289d49540.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Improve what is already there, or build your own infrastructure where you want to, as long as you have the money to do so of course.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 They had it coming</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/07bd866c4560f02cc8d3dcbc3f9f0a92.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/07bd866c4560f02cc8d3dcbc3f9f0a92.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/07bd866c4560f02cc8d3dcbc3f9f0a92.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tired of getting constantly bombed? Double it and give it to the next person, as long as you've lasted in command long enough to be trusted with the RAF Bomber Command.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 A lot of room for possibilities </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/e99e950617f11999793d23d6dd684f4b.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/e99e950617f11999793d23d6dd684f4b.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/e99e950617f11999793d23d6dd684f4b.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The map size gives you room to approach situations however you want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Explore the Tech Tree </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock new technologies with money to improve existing technology, or unlock new buildings and tech.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 About</h2>War Room: Blitz is a single-player, turn-based strategy game based on historical events of the second half of 1940 and the first half of 1941. Test your luck and your managing skills in this fast-paced unit management game. Control your units and lead your country to victory!<br><br>With almost no artificial restrictions put in place, your ability to lead is the only thing that separates you from winning or loosing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a38ee0d7473edff28652108ace9e0bd9.avif?t=1716620124\" width=320 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Keep an eye on your units </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/5d51a60331d962e5e2c43d19647c0e54.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Micromanage of the squadrons on your side, or play loosey-goosey and send them off to distant lands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Upgrade your stuff</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/abbc97bb0997d0e070b52df289d49540.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/abbc97bb0997d0e070b52df289d49540.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https