img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.poster.avif?t=1716620124\" width=568 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.webm?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931390/extras/a75ae3a75fe3e9318a70d1bf4fed2adb.mp4?t=1716620124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock new technologies with money to improve existing technology, or unlock new buildings and tech.",
